-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Badaboom!_Hexbuster_Hammer\" title=\"Badaboom! Hexbuster Hammer\"><img alt=\"Catalyst Anemo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Catalyst Anemo.png\" data-image-key=\"Catalyst_Anemo.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Catalyst_Anemo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20210607092830\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Badaboom!_Hexbuster_Hammer\" title=\"Badaboom! Hexbuster Hammer\">Badaboom! Hexbuster Hammer</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Skill</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring-A-Ding-Ding!_Hexhunter_Chime\" title=\"Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime\"><img alt=\"Talent Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Ring-A-Ding-Ding%21_Hexhunter_Chime.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f7/Talent_Ring-A-Ding-Ding%21_Hexhunter_Chime.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260525041910\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Ring-A-Ding-Ding!_Hexhunter_Chime\" title=\"Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime\">Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Burst</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bell_Tolls!_The_Hunt_Is_On!\" title=\"The Bell Tolls! The Hunt Is On!\"><img alt=\"Talent The Bell Tolls! The Hunt Is On!\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQ